{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112993","id":3031156478,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc60q8b-","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112993","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112993.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112993.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112993","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112993/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112993/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112993/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8c42aeb39fac9cc8d0665a3a622b18468a9bf14d","number":112993,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Improve drag and drop in `Tree`","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #54400, closes [#3201](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3201).\r\n\r\nThis PR improves intuitiveness and usability for moving nodes via drag and drop in `Tree`, by:\r\n\r\n1. Adding an always-present vertical component to the drop indicator, that points up to a to-be parent in the future place of their relationship line, as well as a phantom dropdown arrow when about to be the first ever child of a node.\r\n\r\n2. Considering the x position of the cursor in determining to-be parent when in indent space (negative space to the left), akin to functionality seen in vector design software. When in item space, the current behaviour that users expect is largely maintained.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7ba81d9-3d81-4e9d-b646-d94a0dd895d4\r\n\r\n3. Moving the drop indicator drawing outside of `draw_item`, and placing it on its own CanvasItem, that StyleBoxes that could previously occlude it no longer do.\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| ------------- | ------------- |\r\n|<img width=\"350\" height=\"81\" alt=\"tree-before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7008cf23-1aed-4ffa-b18c-0b79a4bf01a3\" />|<img width=\"350\" height=\"81\" alt=\"tree-after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/024ab8d8-ff62-4019-a00f-221231290b66\" />|\r\n\r\n4. Preventing invalid drop targets, so unhandled cases of dropping as a descendant of self are no longer possible.\r\n\r\nThese changes allow for much more fluid interactions with the tree, where any kind of rearrangement the user might want to do is possible within a single mouse click, while also more clearly telegraphing relationships post-release.\r\n\r\ncc @kleonc","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor",